<h3 id="npu-aot-compilation" data-text="NPU AOT Compilation" tabindex="-1" role="presentation"><span class="devsite-heading" role="heading" aria-level="3">NPU AOT Compilation</span><button type="button" class="devsite-heading-link button-flat material-icons" aria-label="Copy link to this section: NPU AOT Compilation" data-title="Copy link to this section: NPU AOT Compilation" data-id="npu-aot-compilation"></button></h3>

